e-And-Container-Layers#Check-the-result","abstract":[{"text":"Create the SpriteKit scene that will later become a texture on each SceneKit cube face.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/tutorials\/cube-one-stroke-puzzle\/01-spritekit-scene-and-container-layers#Check-the-result","role":"pseudoSymbol","kind":"section","type":"section","title":"Check the result"}}}